@startuml FoodRescue_Expiry_Handling

title FoodRescue — Food Expiry Handling Activity

start

:Select active food listings;
:Check current time against expiry time;

if (Expiry time passed?) then (No)

    if (More than 24 hours remaining?) then (Yes)

        :Classify as Normal;

    else (No)

        if (6–24 hours remaining?) then (Yes)

            :Classify as Attention;

        else (No)

            :Classify as Urgent;

        endif

    endif

    :Display expiry urgency;
    :Notify relevant users when required;

else (Yes)

    :Mark listing as Expired;
    :Prevent new food requests;

    :Check for pending requests;

    if (Pending request exists?) then (Yes)

        :Cancel affected pending request;
        :Notify recipient;
        :Notify donor;

    else (No)

        :Continue without request cancellation;

    endif

    :Record expiry event;

endif

stop

@enduml